[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352214200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111070#issuecomment-3352214200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111070","id":3352214200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hzrq4","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T13:36:45Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T13:36:45Z","body":"This is fascinating. It kind of addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10707, too (see [my comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10707#discussioncomment-10619660)).\r\n\r\nRight off the bat, one thing that personally bothers me is using `Shift` as the modifier for individual multi-selection.\r\nFor this purpose, most software and Godot itself uses `Ctrl` as the modifier. So right now, this PR is not consistent. Holding `Shift` generally allows you to select all items **between** the last selected item and the currently selected item.\r\n\r\nFor reference, see the Scene dock and how Node selection works there. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352214200/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352301473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111070#issuecomment-3352301473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111070","id":3352301473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H0A-h","user":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T13:55:15Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T13:55:15Z","body":"Makes sense, I'll change that. Should shift also select all properties in between? That might get pretty complicated depending on their folding status, but not sure","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352301473/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app