odotengine/godot/pull/111070#issuecomment-3353094561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111070","id":3353094561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H3Cmh","user":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:11:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T17:11:07Z","body":"@chocola-mint Yeah that's a color picker thing.The preview updates as you drag the color around, but the actual property doesn't set until you let go or close. I think it's to avoid any setter code running so many times. But you'll see the spin boxes updates as you drag, but still at like a low \"frame rate\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353094561/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353260130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111070#issuecomment-3353260130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/